GIVEN `the member holds different classes of shares with different information rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of nominated persons` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of shares conferring the particular right` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 148(6) the effect of the nominations made by the member is suspended to the extent that they confer that right` MEANS
    IF `the member holds different classes of shares with different information rights` AND `the number of nominated persons` GREATER THAN `the number of shares conferring the particular right`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where (a) the member holds different classes of shares with different information rights, and (b) there are more nominated persons than he has shares conferring a particular right"

-- "the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the company's enquiry was sent": the first day counts, so the
-- 28th day is the date plus 27 (fork F3).
-- src:1945 | (7) Where the company—
-- src:1946 | (a) enquires of a nominated person whether he wishes to retain information rights, and
-- src:1947 | (b) does not receive a response within the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the company's enquiry was sent,
-- src:1948 | the nomination ceases to have effect at the end of that period.
@ref s 148(7) The nomination ceases to have effect if there is no response within 28 days (src:1945-1948)
GIVEN `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 148(7) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the enquiry was sent` MEANS
    `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent` PLUS 27

@ref s 148(7) The nomination ceases to have effect if there is no response within 28 days (src:1945-1948)
GIVEN `the company enquires of the nominated person whether he wishes to retain information rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent` IS A DATE
      `the date on which the company receives a response` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the day on which the question is asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 148(7) the nomination has ceased to have effect` MEANS
    IF NOT `the company enquires of the nominated person whether he wishes to retain information rights`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the company (a) enquires of a nominated person whether he wishes to retain information rights"
    ELSE CONSIDER `the date on which the company receives a response`
         WHEN JUST received THEN
             IF received AT MOST `s 148(7) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the enquiry was sent` `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent`
             THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) does not receive a response within the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the company's enquiry was sent"
             ELSE IF `the day on which the question is asked` GREATER THAN `s 148(7) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the enquiry was sent` `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent`
                  THEN JUST TRUE
                  ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the nomination ceases to have effect at the end of that period" (the period has not ended)
         WHEN NOTHING THEN
             IF `the day on which the question is asked` GREATER THAN `s 148(7) the last day of the period of 28 days beginning with the date on which the enquiry was sent` `the date on which the company's enquiry was sent`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the nomination ceases to have effect at the end of that period" (the period has not ended)

-- src:1949 | Such an enquiry is not to be made of a person more than once in any twelve-month period.
@ref s 148(7) Such an enquiry is not to be made more than once in any twelve-month period (src:1949)
GIVEN `the date of the earlier enquiry made of the person` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date of the proposed enquiry` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 148(7) the company may make the enquiry of the person` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date of the earlier enquiry made of the person`
    WHEN JUST earlier THEN
        IF `the date of the proposed enquiry` LESS THAN `add months` earlier 12
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Such an enquiry is not to be made of a person more than once in any twelve-month period"
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence only forbids a second enquiry within twelve months and says nothing of when an enquiry may be made
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence only forbids a second enquiry within twelve months and says nothing of when an enquiry may be made

-- src:1950 | (8) The termination or suspension of a nomination means that the company is not required to act on it.
@ref s 148(8) The company is not required to act on a terminated or suspended nomination (src:1950)
