-- ---- s 149: information as to possible rights in relation to voting ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:1952 | 149 Information as to possible rights in relation to voting
-- src:1953 | (1) This section applies where a company sends a copy of a notice of a meeting to a person nominated under section 146 (nomination of person to enjoy information rights)
