    ELSE IF `the date on which the nomination was received by the company` GREATER THAN `the date as at which the members are determined` OR `that date falls in a period of suspension of the nomination`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the company need not send or supply it to a nominated person— (i) whose nomination was received by the company after that date or time, or (ii) if that date or time falls in a period of suspension of his nomination"

