    ELSE IF `the member exercises such rights in different ways`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A member who exercises such rights in different ways"

@ref s 152(3) A member who exercises rights in different ways must inform the company (src:1990)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 145 act under Part 9`
`s 152(3) the member must inform the company of the ways in which he is exercising the rights (duty)` MEANS
    PARTY Member
    MUST `s 152(3) the member informs the company of the ways in which he is exercising the rights`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Member BECAUSE "the member did not inform the company of the ways in which he is exercising the rights"

-- src:1991 | (4) If a member exercises such rights without informing the company—
-- src:1992 | (a) that he is not exercising all his rights, or
-- src:1993 | (b) that he is exercising his rights in different ways,
-- src:1994 | the company is entitled to assume that he is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way.
@ref s 152(4) The company may assume that all the rights are exercised in the same way (src:1991-1994)
GIVEN `the member exercises such rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the member has informed the company that he is not exercising all his rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the member has informed the company that he is exercising his rights in different ways` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 152(4) the company is entitled to assume that the member is exercising all his rights and is exercising them in the same way` MEANS
    IF `the member exercises such rights` AND ((NOT `the member has informed the company that he is not exercising all his rights`) OR (NOT `the member has informed the company that he is exercising his rights in different ways`))
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a member exercises such rights without informing the company (a) that he is not exercising all his rights, or (b) that he is exercising his rights in different ways, the company is entitled to assume"

-- ---- s 153: exercise of rights where shares are held on behalf of others: members' requests -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `s 153(1) section of the Companies Act 2006` IS ONE OF
    `s 153(1)(a) section 314 (power to require circulation of statement)`
    `s 153(1)(b) section 338 (public companies: power to require circulation of resolution for AGM)`
    `s 153(1)(ba) section 338A (traded companies: members' power to include matters in business dealt with at AGM)`
    `s 153(1)(c) section 342 (power to require independent report on poll)`
    `s 153(1)(d) section 527 (power to require website publication of audit concerns)`
    `s 153(1) another section`

-- src:1995 | 153 Exercise of rights where shares held on behalf of others: members' requests
-- src:1996 | (1) This section applies for the purposes of—
-- src:1997 | (a) section 314 (power to require circulation of statement),
-- src:1998 | (b) section 338 (public companies: power to require circulation of resolution for AGM),
-- src:1999 | (ba) section 338A (traded companies: members' power to include matters in business dealt with at AGM),
-- src:2000 | (c) section 342 (power to require independent report on poll), and
-- src:2001 | (d) section 527 (power to require website publication of audit concerns).
@ref s 153(1) The sections for the purposes of which the section applies (src:1995-2001)
GIVEN section IS A `s 153(1) section of the Companies Act 2006`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 153(1) this section applies for the purposes of the section` MEANS
    CONSIDER section
    WHEN `s 153(1)(a) section 314 (power to require circulation of statement)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 153(1)(b) section 338 (public companies: power to require circulation of resolution for AGM)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 153(1)(ba) section 338A (traded companies: members' power to include matters in business dealt with at AGM)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 153(1)(c) section 342 (power to require independent report on poll)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 153(1)(d) section 527 (power to require website publication of audit concerns)` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 153(1) another section` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "This section applies for the purposes of" lists five sections without "only"

-- The request, one field per limb of s 153(2), each name prefixed with the limb. For (c) and (d) the fields say whether
-- every person to whom the limb applies is accompanied by the statement the limb lists.
-- src:2002 | (2) A company is required to act under any of those sections if it receives a request in relation to which the following conditions are met—
-- src:2003 | (a) it is made by at least 100 persons;
-- src:2004 | (b) it is authenticated by all the persons making it;
-- src:2005 | (c) in the case of any of those persons who is not a member of the company, it is accompanied by a statement—
-- src:2006 | (i) of the full name and address of a person (“the member”) who is a member of the company and holds shares on behalf of that person,
-- src:2007 | (ii) that the member is holding those shares on behalf of that person in the course of a business,
-- src:2008 | (iii) of the number of shares in the company that the member holds on behalf of that person,
-- src:2009 | (iv) of the total amount paid up on those shares,
-- src:2010 | (v) that those shares are not held on behalf of anyone else or, if they are, that the other person or persons are not among the other persons making the request,
-- src:2011 | (vi) that some or all of those shares confer voting rights that are relevant for the purposes of making a request under the section in question, and
-- src:2012 | (vii) that the person has the right to instruct the member how to exercise those rights;
-- src:2013 | (d) in the case of any of those persons who is a member of the company, it is accompanied by a statement—
-- src:2014 | (i) that he holds shares otherwise than on behalf of another person, or
-- src:2015 | (ii) that he holds shares on behalf of one or more other persons but those persons are not among the other persons making the request;
-- src:2016 | (e) it is accompanied by such evidence as the company may reasonably require of the matters mentioned in paragraph (c) and (d);
-- src:2017 | (f) the total amount of the sums paid up on—
-- src:2018 | (i) shares held as mentioned in paragraph (c), and
-- src:2019 | (ii) shares held as mentioned in paragraph (d),
-- src:2020 | divided by the number of persons making the request, is not less than £100;
-- src:2021 | (g) the request complies with any other requirements of the section in question as to contents, timing and otherwise.
@ref s 153(2) The conditions a request must meet (src:2002-2021)
DECLARE `s 153(2) request` HAS
    `s 153(2)(a) the number of persons making the request` IS A NUMBER
    `s 153(2)(b) the request is authenticated by all the persons making it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(i) each person who is not a member gives the full name and address of the member who holds shares on behalf of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(ii) each person who is not a member states that the member holds those shares on behalf of that person in the course of a business` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(iii) each person who is not a member states the number of shares in the company that the member holds on behalf of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(iv) each person who is not a member states the total amount paid up on those shares` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(v) each person who is not a member states that those shares are not held on behalf of anyone else or, if they are, that the others are not among the other persons making the request` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(vi) each person who is not a member states that some or all of those shares confer voting rights relevant for the section in question` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(c)(vii) each person who is not a member states that the person has the right to instruct the member how to exercise those rights` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(d)(i) each person who is a member states that he holds shares otherwise than on behalf of another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(d)(ii) each person who is a member states that he holds shares on behalf of one or more other persons who are not among the other persons making the request` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(e) the request is accompanied by such evidence as the company may reasonably require of the matters mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `s 153(2)(f) the total amount of the sums paid up on the shares held as mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d)` IS A NUMBER
    `s 153(2)(g) the request complies with any other requirements of the section in question as to contents, timing and otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref s 153(2)(a) At least 100 persons (src:2003)
GIVEN `the number of persons making the request` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 153(2)(a) the request is made by at least 100 persons` MEANS
    IF `the number of persons making the request` AT LEAST 100
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it is made by at least 100 persons"

@ref s 153(2)(f) The average sum paid up is not less than 100 pounds (src:2017-2020)
GIVEN `the number of persons making the request` IS A NUMBER
      `the total amount of the sums paid up on the shares held as mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d), in pounds` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 153(2)(f) the total paid up divided by the number of persons making the request is not less than 100 pounds` MEANS
    IF `the number of persons making the request` AT MOST 0
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text does not divide by a number of persons that is not positive
    ELSE IF (`the total amount of the sums paid up on the shares held as mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d), in pounds` DIVIDED BY `the number of persons making the request`) AT LEAST 100
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "divided by the number of persons making the request, is not less than £100"

@ref s 153(2) The conditions a request must meet (src:2002-2021)
GIVEN request IS A `s 153(2) request`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 153(2) the company is required to act under the section on the request` MEANS
    IF request's `s 153(2)(a) the number of persons making the request` LESS THAN 100
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) it is made by at least 100 persons"
    ELSE IF       request's `s 153(2)(b) the request is authenticated by all the persons making it`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(i) each person who is not a member gives the full name and address of the member who holds shares on behalf of that person`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(ii) each person who is not a member states that the member holds those shares on behalf of that person in the course of a business`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(iii) each person who is not a member states the number of shares in the company that the member holds on behalf of that person`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(iv) each person who is not a member states the total amount paid up on those shares`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(v) each person who is not a member states that those shares are not held on behalf of anyone else or, if they are, that the others are not among the other persons making the request`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(vi) each person who is not a member states that some or all of those shares confer voting rights relevant for the section in question`
              AND request's `s 153(2)(c)(vii) each person who is not a member states that the person has the right to instruct the member how to exercise those rights`
              AND (    request's `s 153(2)(d)(i) each person who is a member states that he holds shares otherwise than on behalf of another person`
                   OR  request's `s 153(2)(d)(ii) each person who is a member states that he holds shares on behalf of one or more other persons who are not among the other persons making the request`)
              AND request's `s 153(2)(e) the request is accompanied by such evidence as the company may reasonably require of the matters mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d)`
              AND (request's `s 153(2)(f) the total amount of the sums paid up on the shares held as mentioned in paragraphs (c) and (d)` DIVIDED BY request's `s 153(2)(a) the number of persons making the request`) AT LEAST 100
              AND request's `s 153(2)(g) the request complies with any other requirements of the section in question as to contents, timing and otherwise`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A company is required to act under any of those sections if it receives a request in relation to which the following conditions are met"

@ref s 153(2) The conditions a request must meet (src:2002)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 145 act under Part 9`
`s 153(2) the company must act under the section on a request that meets the conditions (duty)` MEANS
    PARTY Company
    MUST `s 153(2) the company acts under the section`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company BECAUSE "the company did not act under the section on a request that met the conditions of s 153(2)"
